      "name": "SpotQualityRecord_centroid_intensity",
      "definition_uri": "https://w3id.org/fof-ct/centroid_intensity",
      "description": "Signal intensity of the centroid pixel of the Spot / localization. Reserved, conditionally-required column name (Centroid_Intensity) in the Spot Quality, RNA Spot Quality, and SM Localization Quality tables.",
      "examples": [
        {
          "value": "2500.0",
          "@type": "Example"
