      "description": "Free-text description of how ROI boundaries are encoded, beyond what the format name alone conveys (e.g. coordinate order, dimensionality, or an external file reference). Conditionally required (content-triggered): MANDATORY when roi_boundaries_format_type is 'Other'; otherwise recommended.",
      "examples": [
        {
          "value": "Cell boundaries are reported in global coordinates as lists of comma separated x,y coordinates separated by spaces like \"x1,y1 x2,y2 x3,y3\" (e.g. \"0,0 1,2 3,5\").",
          "@type": "Example"
        }
      ],
