    {
      "name": "Cell",
      "definition_uri": "https://w3id.org/fof-ct/Cell",
      "description": "A single Cell identified in a FOF-bas-CT experiment. Each instance of this class corresponds to one row in the TSV data section of the FOF-CT Cell Data table. The cell_id field uniquely identifies each Cell and links to the core table, the Sub-Cell ROI Data table, and the Cell/ROI Mapping table. This class accepts additional user-defined optional columns (e.g. Cell_Size, Cell_Volume, Cell_Cycle_State, RNA_Spot_Count) via open schema. At least one such user-defined column MUST be present per submission.",
