      "description": "The SM Localization Data table of a FOF-vol-CT dataset (namespace: FOF-CT_vol_core, no 4dn_ prefix). This is the mandatory primary data table for volumetric FOF-CT submissions. Each row corresponds to one SM localization event. The Spot/Trace Data table is optional for FOF-vol-CT submissions but may be included to report post-processing results derived from the localization data.",
