      "name": "UndecodedLocalization",
      "definition_uri": "https://w3id.org/fof-ct/UndecodedLocalization",
      "description": "A single raw, undecoded SM localization event in a FOF-vol-CT dataset. Each instance corresponds to one row in the TSV data section of the Undecoded SM Localization Data table. This class uses LocalizationMixin for the shared loc_id, x, y, z slots. The 8 mandatory columns, in order, are: Loc_ID, Hyb_ID, Image_Frame_ID, X, Y, Z, Channel, Fluor. TheZ (the_z) is a reserved, conditionally-required column for the focal Z-plane identifier.",
      "from_schema": "https://w3id.org/fof-ct/undecoded",
